data live_tree_disposition: LiveTreeDisposition = SubstrateInputsOnly

// THE FIXTURE IS A DESIGNED SESSION SNAPSHOT, not a captured one: nine issues over three users'
// worth of relations (two users, a three-node component tree, a blocking edge pair, one
// duplicated issue), constructed so every stock view's expected subset is EXACT — each view claim
// below pins the real sidebar roster's semantics by deriving the subset from the modeled
// derivations and comparing identity lists. The subscription facts are the designed per-user
// state; the issue resources' cc/stars/upvotes display fields are authored to agree with them and
// claim w_cc_facts_mirror_issue_cc_field pins that agreement.

